  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="75.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 75.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se ðe þæt wepn age, hine geladige, gyf he durre, ðæt hit næfre næs naðer ne his gewill ne his geweald ne his ræd ne his gewitnes; ðonne is þæt Godes riht, þæt he beo clæne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who owns the weapon shall clear himself, if he dare, asserting that the mischief was done without his desire or authority or advice or cognisance; then according to the law of God he shall be clear [of any charge of complicity].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe þæt wæpn áge, hine geladige, gif he durre, þæt hit næfre næs naðer ne his gewill ne his geweald ne his ræd ne his gewitnes: þonne is þæt Godes riht, þæt he beo clæne.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
